# Blip icons: commerce. MIT licence.
#
# One block per icon: a header '@ <kebab-name> tags: word, word', then exactly 12 rows of 12 characters, 'X' for a
# pixel and '.' for empty. Rules (docs/icons.md): keep a one-pixel margin; outlines are one pixel wide; lone marks
# (plus, check, chevrons, arrows) are two; diagonals step evenly; closed shapes drop their corner pixels.
# Run the build after editing: it checks every map and traces it into SVG.

